---
description: Arcane guidance adapter for module ownership and dependency direction
globs: Modules/**/*,Content.*/*.csproj,Content.*.*/*.csproj
alwaysApply: false
---
For root `Content.*` projects, consult `Modules/CATALOG.md` and the linked owner/project guide; those guides are stored separately from the runtime source. Verify ownership and dependency direction from the actual project references. Read a `module.yml` only when one exists for the selected runtime owner.

Classify sync-sensitive source/resource edits against `.agents/rules/fork-trajectory-priority.md`. Prefer root `Content.Arcane.*` and existing `_Arcane` resource paths for Arcane-only behavior; use the provenance-based exceptions in `.agents/rules/port-destination.md` for confirmed TraumaStation additions and Trauma-side revert restorations.

Use Arcane edit markers for our changes to inherited game code/resources when the canonical rule requires them. Instruction/documentation edits do not use gameplay edit markers. See `.cursor/rules/core.mdc` and `.agents/rules/arcane-edit-markers.md`.
